# "Remove three counters from among creatures you control" takes counters of any kinds (CR 118.3, 122.1), and from a creature with
# several kinds the payer chooses which. Bot1's Sylvan Caryatid, blighted twice by Dawnhand Dissident's exile, then gets a flying, a
# first strike and a lifelink counter from Abigale, Eloquent First-Year (losing its own abilities). Casting the exiled Llanowar Elves,
# Bot1 removes the Caryatid's flying and first strike counters and the Dissident's -1/-1 counter: the Caryatid keeps its two -1/-1
# counters and its lifelink counter, and with them lifelink (CR 122.1b); the Dissident is a 1/2 again.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Dawnhand Dissident
Forest
Mox Emerald
Sylvan Caryatid
Abigale, Eloquent First-Year
Plains
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dawnhand Dissident.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sylvan Caryatid.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Dawnhand Dissident.Activate(Ability: Surveil)
Bot1.Choose(Tap Dawnhand Dissident)
Bot1.Choose(Dawnhand Dissident)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange( | Llanowar Elves)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Dawnhand Dissident.Activate(Bot1.Graveyard.Llanowar Elves; Ability: Exile target)
Bot1.Choose(Tap Dawnhand Dissident)
Bot1.Choose(Sylvan Caryatid)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Abigale, Eloquent First-Year.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Target(Sylvan Caryatid)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Sylvan Caryatid.Counters.Flying = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#2.Activate
Bot1.Exile.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.RemoveCounters(Sylvan Caryatid: Flying 1; Sylvan Caryatid: FirstStrike 1; Dawnhand Dissident: 1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Sylvan Caryatid.Counters.MinusOneMinusOne = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Sylvan Caryatid.Counters.Lifelink = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Sylvan Caryatid.Counters.Flying = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Sylvan Caryatid.Counters.FirstStrike = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Sylvan Caryatid.Keywords = Lifelink
Bot1.Battlefield.Dawnhand Dissident.Toughness = 2
Exile.Count = 0
